 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-04-18",
   "text": "FHA Foreclosure Prevention Act of 2018 \n This bill amends the National Housing Act to expand foreclosure-prevention measures for homes insured by the Federal Housing Administration. Specifically, the bill revises requirements concerning insurance benefits, mortgage-servicer oversight, complaint procedures, and notice to borrowers."
  }
